{"url": "https://x.com/PixelRainbowNFT/status/2105442711696179348", "id": "2105442711696179348", "text": "And now for my next trick...  \n\na Safari 27 GrokBot Template:\nhttps://x.ai/bot/8obMM4mRWRLf51EB2n4JV\n\nto turn your @bot into a Safari 27 guru, optimizer, knowledge nerd and implementer. \n\nIf you didn't already know... Apple Safari 27 just shipped WebDriver as an MCP server (safaridriver --mcp).\n\nI published a Grok Bot template so your agents can measure real Safari pages the way day-one indexers and AI browsers will: smoke packs, pre-DNS bake-in checks, evidence gates, and a weekly sustain loop.\n\nNo Chromium cosplay. Accessibility tree \u2192 ranked defects \u2192 keep it green.\n\nI've been banging on this while building out 3 agent-friendly e-commerce stores...hopefully it helps you get your websites ready, Freddy.", "raw_text": {"text": "And now for my next trick...  \n\na Safari 27 GrokBot Template:\nhttps://t.co/i4N3Vl8lcz\n\nto turn your @bot into a Safari 27 guru, optimizer, knowledge nerd and implementer. \n\nIf you didn't already know... Apple Safari 27 just shipped WebDriver as an MCP server (safaridriver --mcp).\n\nI published a Grok Bot template so your agents can measure real Safari pages the way day-one indexers and AI browsers will: smoke packs, pre-DNS bake-in checks, evidence gates, and a weekly sustain loop.\n\nNo Chromium cosplay. Accessibility tree \u2192 ranked defects \u2192 keep it green.\n\nI've been banging on this while building out 3 agent-friendly e-commerce stores...hopefully it helps you get your websites ready, Freddy.", "display_text_range": [0, 699], "facets": [{"type": "italic", "indices": [0, 30]}, {"type": "bold", "indices": [34, 61]}, {"type": "url", "indices": [62, 85], "original": "https://t.co/i4N3Vl8lcz", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/8obMM4mRWRLf51EB2n4JV", "display": "x.ai/bot/8obMM4mRWR\u2026"}, {"type": "mention", "indices": [100, 104], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "bold", "i